    [15397]={name="Oakthrush Staff",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Fragments Within” — pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Fragments Within",lore="The moonwell water has revealed that embedded inside the crystal are a few small fragments of bone, as well as half of a jawbone."},
    [15399]={name="Dryweed Belt",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Washed Ashore” — pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Washed Ashore",lore="That beached creature is not an isolated incident here in Darkshore. There are more along the coastline and even in the water."},
    [15403]={name="Ridgeback Bracers",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “WANTED: Murkdeep!” — pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="WANTED: Murkdeep!",lore="Attention! A reward is being offered for the death of the murloc \"Murkdeep\"."},
    [15444]={name="Staff of Orgrimmar",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Hidden Enemies” — pick it over the other choices. In Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Hidden Enemies",lore="You are one of my lieutenants! Prepare yourself. I will call upon you soon. My time spent on the Searing Blade may be all but wasted now, but that does not mean that the Shadow Council's schemes elsewhere must suffer."},
    [15449]={name="Ghastly Trousers",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Power to Destroy...” — pick it over the other choices. In Ragefire Chasm.",zone="Ragefire Chasm",questName="The Power to Destroy...",lore="Many denizens of the Legion bestow gifts on their followers as you may well know. Some of these gifts the Dark Lady feels would be better off in her hands than in the hands of those with..."},
    [15450]={name="Dredgemire Leggings",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Power to Destroy...” — pick it over the other choices. In Ragefire Chasm.",zone="Ragefire Chasm",questName="The Power to Destroy...",lore="Many denizens of the Legion bestow gifts on their followers as you may well know. Some of these gifts the Dark Lady feels would be better off in her hands than in the hands of those with..."},
    [15452]={name="Featherbead Bracers",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Returning the Lost Satchel” — pick it over the other choices. In Ragefire Chasm.",zone="Ragefire Chasm",questName="Returning the Lost Satchel",lore="You find a satchel under the body of the tauren. It is still gripped tightly in his arms as though he was trying to protect it while being attacked by the troggs."},
    [15453]={name="Savannah Bracers",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Returning the Lost Satchel” — pick it over the other choices. In Ragefire Chasm.",zone="Ragefire Chasm",questName="Returning the Lost Satchel",lore="You find a satchel under the body of the tauren. It is still gripped tightly in his arms as though he was trying to protect it while being attacked by the troggs."},
    [15456]={name="Lightstep Leggings",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Hints of a New Plague?” — pick it over the other choices. In Hillsbrad Foothills.",zone="Hillsbrad Foothills",questName="Hints of a New Plague?",lore="I've seen Kinelory look way worse after a night in the tavern than she does now. You obviously did a good job protecting her."},
    [15458]={name="Tundra Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Grimtotem Spying” — pick it over the other choices. In Thousand Needles.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Grimtotem Spying",lore="you have served us well in the past, so I now entrust to you an important mission. The Grimtotem Clan is up to something secretive. Three agents of unknown origin were seen visiting the Grimtotem over the recent weeks."},
    [15461]={name="Lightheel Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Protect Kanati Greycloud” — pick it over the other choices. In Thousand Needles.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Protect Kanati Greycloud",lore="But, there may be more centaur than I thought, I ask you, to fight with me against these vile assassins."},
    [15462]={name="Loamflake Bracers",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Protect Kanati Greycloud” — pick it over the other choices. In Thousand Needles.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Protect Kanati Greycloud",lore="But, there may be more centaur than I thought, I ask you, to fight with me against these vile assassins."},
    [15468]={name="Windsong Drape",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Free at Last” — pick it over the other choices. In Thousand Needles.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Free at Last",lore="Arnak thinks we're going to be married... but after I declined his offer he came back that night and kidnapped me. My brother tried to stop him, but Arnak was too strong."},
    [15471]={name="Brawnhide Armor",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem” — pick it over the other choices. In Thousand Needles.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem",lore="Wanted: Arnak Grimtotem Arnak the outcast is wanted for the heinous crimes of murder and kidnapping. Handsome rewards will be given to those brave enough to bring this criminal to justice."},
    [15708]={name="Blight Leather Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “A Final Blow” — pick it over the other choices. In Felwood.",zone="Felwood",questName="A Final Blow",lore="Unfortunately, I see the only way to stop this threat to Felwood is a frontal attack. There are no other ways into Shadow Hold, and I have no means to teleport you inside."},
    [15805]={name="Penelope's Rose",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Kirtonos the Herald” — pick it over the other choices. In Scholomance.",zone="Scholomance",questName="Kirtonos the Herald",lore="This is it. The blood of innocents. The purest blood, used to appease Krastinov's master. It is with this blood that Kirtonos may be summoned."},
    [15822]={name="Shadowskin Spaulders",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Runecloth” — pick it over the other choices. In Timbermaw Hold.",zone="Timbermaw Hold",questName="Runecloth",lore="In Timbermaw, we are content. We do not like strangers. This is good for us, but it is bad for trade. Not long ago, a rare night elf friend came to Timbermaw and she wore a runecloth cloak."},
    [15825]={name="Traphook Jerkin",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Put Her Down” — pick it over the other choices. In Blackrock Spire.",zone="Blackrock Spire",questName="Put Her Down",lore="You have no doubt seen the worgs which the Blackrock orcs command. It is curious - no matter how many we destroy, their numbers never dwindle."},
    [15855]={name="Ring of Protection",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Hidden Treasures”. In Eastern Plaguelands.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Hidden Treasures",lore="Daddy told me to give you this key. He said it opens a chest out back behind the house. He also wanted me to thank you. Did you do a favor for him?"},
